    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "LWK are delighted to present 32 Hillview Estate, Ballinteer to the market.\r\n\r\nThis superb three-bedroom terraced home comes to the market in excellent condition throughout and offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation in a highly sought-after residential location.\r\n\r\nUpon entering, you are welcomed by a stylish, panelled entrance hallway, setting the tone for the home. To the front, the spacious living room is filled with natural light, providing an ideal space to relax and entertain. To the rear, the generous open-plan kitchen/dining room features a fitted kitchen with ample storage and worktop space. Sliding patio doors open onto a low-maintenance rear garden, perfect for outdoor dining and family enjoyment.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the property comprises three well-appointed bedrooms, including two generous double bedrooms and a third bedroom that can also comfortably accommodate a double bed. The recently renovated family bathroom is finished to a high standard and features a walk-in power shower.\r\n\r\n32 Hillview Estate enjoys an exceptional location in the heart of Ballinteer, with a wide selection of highly regarded primary and secondary schools within walking distance or a short drive, making it an ideal choice for families.\r\n\r\nFor everyday convenience, Dundrum Village is just a short stroll away, while Dundrum Town Centre is approximately a 20-minute walk and offers an extensive selection of shops, supermarkets, cafés, restaurants, a cinema, theatre, and leisure facilities including a gym. Ballinteer Shopping Centre and an excellent range of local amenities are also close by.\r\n\r\nThe area is exceptionally well served by public transport, with the LUAS Green Line within easy reach and numerous bus routes providing direct access to Dublin City Centre. The nearby M50 motorway offers excellent connectivity to Dublin Airport, the city centre, and beyond.\r\n\r\nResidents also benefit from an abundance of nearby parks, walking trails, and sports clubs, providing an ideal balance of peaceful suburban living and easy access to the vibrant amenities of Dundrum and the surrounding areas.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Excellent three-bedroom terraced home\r\nPresented in excellent condition throughout\r\nOff-street parking\r\nRear lane access\r\nLow-maintenance rear garden\r\nRecently renovated family bathroom with walk-in power shower\r\nGas-fired central heating (GFCH)\r\nDouble-glazed windows\r\nBER B2 – qualifying for green mortgage rates (subject to lender criteria)\r\nExcellent transport links including LUAS, bus routes, and M50\r\nDevelopment potential (subject to the necessary planning permission)"
      },
